Chapter: WgslPlug
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 Plug entry. Reads IR text from serial input (file-mapped by
 codex-vm), runs the WGSL emitter, writes WGSL shader text to
 serial. Kernels are [Device]-effected Codex functions; the emitter
 lowers them to WebGPU compute shaders (structured control flow,
 storage buffers, @compute entry keyed on a trailing gid parameter).

Section: Body

  dispatch : Text -> [Console] Nothing
  dispatch (mode) = act
    source <- read-serial-cce mode
    let parsed = parse-ir-chapter source
    in let output = emit-wgsl-chapter (parsed.chapter) (parsed.type-defs)
    in print-line-uni output
  end

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    mode-result <- read-line-cce
    when mode-result
      is Just (mode) -> dispatch mode
      is None -> print-line-uni "no input"
  end
